{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1000_p", "source_sha256": "25547931e0df75823e0193afeb4a5f85432d2658525ebd2d7f9525c5aa26ebb9", "ja": "（今日は新曲のPV撮影にきている。リゾート地の\n開放感は、思わず日常を忘れてしまいそうだ……）", "zh": "（今天来拍新歌的PV。度假胜地的开阔氛围，让人不由得都快忘了日常生活……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "74f23df588758bb35ad719799e398dbc95a8a564e5e30183b9c2fb53756323e1", "ja": "{$P$}、ぼーっとしてどうしたの？\nもしかして……熱中症とか！？", "zh": "{$P$}，发什么呆呢？\n难道说……中暑了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a9641fe066530706afb3dbe8e3c1beb0edfe00fe3e38b60b091c81444e9aff91", "ja": "ははっ、違うよ。\nちょっと開放感に浸ってただけなんだ。", "zh": "哈哈，不是啦。\n我只是沉浸在放松的感觉里而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "59faddede99fa168d250fb9f0cfa7a825c23919dcf6854c1ee5834aab2bd4567", "ja": "開放感かぁ。それなら、自分もわかるぞ！\n海を前にすると、テンション上がるよね♪", "zh": "开阔感啊。这样的话我也懂！面对大海，情绪就会高涨起来，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "1f719a261d27f02fb07db98f3a64fe3ea08a987232b30bf05cbd8ebab8c3fca8", "ja": "それにしても、今日は暑いね！\n自分、飲み物があるか見にきたんだけど……。", "zh": "不过话说回来，今天真热啊！\n我过来看看有没有饮料……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3f0c199c058cccd396edc846d472787409813bed24622f3f9a618b0cb95cdf8b", "ja": "それならスタッフさんが用意してくれたドリンクが、\nクーラーボックスに入ってるよ。", "zh": "那样的话，工作人员准备的饮料都放在冷藏箱里哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "d8bdaec3fca4520f3f6988022630a21a0e0bb30e3b5aae23bf1c3ca81739861e", "ja": "ありがとう！　みんなの分も、\n何本か持っていってもいい？", "zh": "谢谢！我可以多拿几瓶，\n把大家的份也带过去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1007_p", "source_sha256": "48ed43def86b7d6e8db8acb349e6f21e0a8fe9561b18195ccc8e9f0a0bc037a9", "ja": "もちろん！　助かるよ。\nそれにしても、今日の響はいつもより……。", "zh": "当然可以！帮大忙了。\n不过话说回来，今天的响比平时更……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "c795ae85903048ac0b1aed10bb0e0152e4a757eff70b8df9ee02f6036479d90e", "ja": "いつもより……何？", "zh": "比平时……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1fe98177bf5e25a3ed6798742461b9c07611fa05d7c6b82c7b8cd165bfb156cc", "ja": "ああ、いや。響の面倒見がいいのは、\nいつもの事のはずなんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，不是。响平时就很会照顾人，应该一直都是这样才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fac768936c278fec84270b37c5dd7b47dbc42de50de7714f301cb025781dd280", "ja": "その衣装のせいもあるのかな？\nなんだかいつもより、すごく優しい感じがするよ。", "zh": "会不会也有那套服装的原因呢？\n感觉你比平时要温柔得多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "1f9bde9ec0ae4f32f9d1ba5b0d2204a1b0e3a0f2198b63a0c487e9ffde1aaa3a", "ja": "そっかぁ。ウェディングドレスって、\n優しい雰囲気があるもんね。", "zh": "这样啊。婚纱确实自带一种温柔的氛围呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "f608d4ad900def9f18ffc7462677179e2e2bdc0f9cf4751eb367c5e512395b65", "ja": "自分も、今回のお仕事で、結婚のイメージが\nちょっとだけできたような、そうでもないような……。", "zh": "通过这次工作，我好像稍微对结婚有了一点想象，又好像没有……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "3a9a829a86fd9a07dc3bf419964dd6cb4ee55ce82c1fd3127056b13ca6974d73", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。\n自分、いいお嫁さんになれると思う？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。\n你觉得我能成为一个好妻子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fccbf706c4990f1641f94ea645ffd240106a7a0bbcfb7db027b2d5f92e542e49", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。響なら……ん？\n響、なんだか呼んでないか？", "zh": "啊，是啊。要是响的话……嗯？响，你是不是在叫我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "f5240b78a3992923cfd4564d81e39147f888dbc76fbadc53ebf966f3fe4a0cbd", "ja": "あっ！？\nすぐ戻るって言ったの、忘れてた！", "zh": "啊！？\n我都忘了自己说过马上回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0333_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "832c97fd1dd0ea276304441260b66a4f9a0ac6f22a342c5b2f0e931e51a4cffa", "ja": "自分、戻るね！　{$P$}も、\n水分補給忘れないでよ！", "zh": "我先回去啦！{$P$}也别忘了补充水分哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
